  "description": "*“I have never belonged anywhere in my life,\nand if it meant I could survive, I wanted to become anything at all.”*\n\nSaepalgam, born between a magpie spirit and a human.  \nEun Seongmok, raised in contempt by his own clan.\n\nWith nowhere to rely on, the two become entangled through a chance connection and come to be each other’s one and only.\n\nA pure yet resilient love story, like plum blossoms in bloom.\n\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230107), [Bomtoon](https://bomtoon.com/detail/aoghkeus), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/maehwadyeon), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10998816), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/120074245), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000062776)",
